evidence_notes = "The Arrow-class name, reconnaissance role, and a written description of two escape pods come from A3's dated page text. B3 records the Arrow label string in footage uploaded 2012-03-23 with no registered frame anchor and no craft tied to it, and its upload date dates neither a recording nor a build. The Arrow name-to-model mapping is therefore unknown: the slender silhouette, proportions, pod appearance and placement, release concept, cockpit, entry, sensors, engines, weapons, materials, and flight values are a provisional modern interpretation; no historical name-to-model mapping is claimed."
